Licence: The Unlicense (public domain dedication)

Vendored rather than fetched at build time on purpose. A catalogue that is
rebuilt from the network produces a different database depending on the day it
was run, and the one thing a seed must be is reproducible.

The images referenced by `images` are in the same repository under
`exercises/<id>/0.jpg` and `1.jpg`. They are NOT vendored here — see
scripts/build-exercise-catalogue.mjs for why the paths are stored rather than
the files.
